# Glasses of Urza taps to look at either player's hand (CR 602.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Glasses of Urza
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glasses of Urza.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Glasses of Urza.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
